     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi there, <div><br></div><div>and sorry if this is not the appropriate list. I&#39;ve seen the announcement of GGally as a companion package to GGplot2 on the R-package diffusion list. But the package is not available on cran or R-forge. Do you know where this package can be obtained? A similar question has been posted on R-package a week ago, without success.</div><div><br></div><div>Best, </div><div><br></div><div>Matthieu </div><br><div>\n<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><b>Matthieu Dubois</b></div><div>Post-doctoral fellow</div><div><br></div><div><i>Denis Pelli&#39;s Lab</i></div><div><i>Department of Psychology</i></div><div><i>New York University, New York, USA</i></div><div><i><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><br></span></i></div><div><i>Gmail: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">matt...@gmail.com</a></i></div><div><i><br></i></div></div></span><br></div></span><br></div></span><br></span><br>\n</div>\n<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
